  </section>

  <section class="container section" id="marketplaces">
    <div class="disclosure">The OpenSea link above is a referral link. If you join through it, I may earn a reward at no extra cost to you. The offer is set by OpenSea and can change. The other links are plain links. NFTs are risky: prices can fall to zero, and scams are common. This is not financial advice. Please read the <a href="/disclaimer">disclaimer</a>.</div>
    <div class="section-head"><div><div class="eyebrow">MARKETPLACES</div><h2>Where to explore NFTs</h2></div></div>
